2026-05-05T10:11:02.278Z {"session_id":"e1054380-8976-4eaa-93ff-2042b3950771","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\yasmi\\.claude\\projects\\E--workstuff-platform-ai-assistant\\e1054380-8976-4eaa-93ff-2042b3950771.jsonl","cwd":"E:\\workstuff\\platform_ai_assistant","permission_mode":"default","hook_event_name":"UserPromptSubmit","prompt":"\"The ingestion is still failing with 60s timeouts. I need you to force-update the LightRAG initialization in 'app/services/lightrag_service.py'.\n\nApply these EXACT parameters to the LightRAG constructor:\n1. embedding_func: Use the existing openai_embed but wrap it with a custom timeout if necessary.\n2. Set `embedding_batch_num=1` to send requests one by one.\n3. Explicitly pass these to the LightRAG class:\n   - embedding_func_max_workers=2\n   - embedding_func_timeout=300.0\n   - llm_func_max_workers=2\n   - llm_func_timeout=600.0\n\nAlso, ensure that in 'ingestion/ingest.py' we are not calling multiple `insert` commands in parallel. Use a simple serial loop for documents.\""}

